  "productivityInrPerManDay": {
    "_note": "Value of work a single worker executes per working day, by trade. Used to derive durations from BOQ value when no schedule is supplied: duration = ceil(packageValue / (crew x productivity)). Calibrated so the SKF Pune BOQ (INR 82.1M / 26,484 sft) reproduces its 75-day contract programme. Material-heavy trades show a higher INR/man-day because material cost dominates the line item.",
